---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How this website handles personal data, hosting, and cookies."
  noindex
>
  <article
    class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-(--space-4) py-(--space-8) md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-(--space-8) md:py-(--space-16)"
  >
    <h1
      class="text-3xl leading-(--leading-title) font-(--font-weight-title) tracking-(--tracking-title)"
    >
      Privacy
    </h1>
    <div
      class="flex max-w-(--layout-prose) flex-col gap-(--space-6) pt-(--space-3) text-base leading-normal font-(--font-weight-text) md:col-span-2"
    >
      <p>
        I take the protection of your personal data seriously. This privacy
        policy explains what data is processed when you visit this website and
        how it is used.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website is operated by me, Sven Finger (<a
          href="mailto:hi@svenfinger.com"
          class="underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-foreground"
          >hi@svenfinger.com</a
        >), and hosted by Cloudflare. Cloudflare also provides DNS, security,
        and Web Analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you visit this website, Cloudflare may process technical connection
        data such as your IP address and browser information to deliver the
        website and protect it against attacks. I do not store or have access to
        personal visitor data and cannot identify individual visitors.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cloudflare Web Analytics and Plausible are privacy-focused and do not
        collect or use personal data, cookies, local storage, or fingerprinting.
        I use no tracking, advertising, or personally identifiable cookies.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you contact me by email, your email address, message, and any
        information you provide will only be used to respond to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        For more information about Cloudflare's processing of data, please see <a
          href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-foreground"
          >Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
